' Reducing a fold inside funding-gated saturation — control flow (swimlanes = owner).
' Render: plantuml -tsvg 12-native-fold-saturation-flow.puml
@startuml
title Reducing a fold inside funding-gated saturation

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
  DiamondBorderColor #1F2937
  DiamondFontColor #111827
}

|#EDE9FE|Saturation loop|
start
:Search a `NativeRule` LHS\n(e.g. `int(?a, ?w)`) for a redex; <<#EDE9FE>>
if (redex matches?) then (yes)
else (no)
  |#FCE7F3|Host-routed / no fold|
  :Leave term unreduced\n(COMM / new / PZero carry no fold body); <<#FCE7F3>>
  stop
endif

|#FEF3C7|Funding|
:For each LHS-var child class,\n`best_derivation` = funded 1-best\n(min inside weight); <<#FEF3C7>>
if (child has a funded reducible derivation?) then (yes)
else (no)
  |#FEE2E2|No merge|
  :Dispatcher returns `None`\n(faithful to a fold premise with no solution); <<#FEE2E2>>
  detach
endif
if (`Δ_fold + margin ≤ Σ` ?) then (funded)
else (Σ exhausted)
  |#FEE2E2|NodeLimit|
  :Stop saturation — underfunded; <<#FEE2E2>>
  stop
endif

|#DDD6FE|Native body|
:Reconstruct typed children from the typed op-enum `L`; <<#DDD6FE>>
:Run the fold body\n`rho_proc_int_bin(&a, w)`; <<#DDD6FE>>
if (bad cast / type mismatch?) then (yes)
  :Result = `Proc::Err`\n(a legitimate, merged fold value); <<#FEF3C7>>
else (no)
  :Result = `Cast*` literal value; <<#DDD6FE>>
endif

|#DCFCE7|Result / extraction|
:`add` the typed result e-node; <<#DCFCE7>>
if (`find(root) ≠ find(result)` ?) then (yes)
  :`merge(root, result)`\n(ADD an equality — prune nothing); <<#DCFCE7>>
else (no — re-fire)
  :`native_refire_is_noop`\n(no merge); <<#DCFCE7>>
endif
:Progress weight makes the folded form\nstrictly cheaper ⇒ funded 1-best\nextraction surfaces the normal form; <<#DCFCE7>>
:Converged; <<#DCFCE7>>
stop

legend right
  |= color |= owner / outcome |
  |<#EDE9FE>| saturation loop |
  |<#FEF3C7>| funding |
  |<#DDD6FE>| native body |
  |<#DCFCE7>| result / normal form |
  |<#FEE2E2>| no merge / underfunded |
  |<#FCE7F3>| host-routed (no fold) |
endlegend
@enduml
